NOTES ON SCOPE (these do not modify the MIT terms above)

1. DATA IS NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENCE.

   The MIT licence above applies to the source code in this repository only. It
   does not apply to any dataset, knowledge graph, or model artifact derived
   from third-party data. Each retains its own licence:

     - DDXPlus ........................ CC-BY-4.0
     - BODHI-S (Eka Care) ............. CC-BY-NC-4.0  (NON-COMMERCIAL)
     - UCI Heart Disease .............. see UCI ML Repository terms
     - Synthea ........................ free of cost/privacy/security restrictions
     - PubMed / PubMed Central ........ NCBI terms; only the PMC Open Access
                                        subset is redistributable

   BODHI-S is licensed for NON-COMMERCIAL use. While this project depends on
   BODHI-S, the project and artifacts derived from it must not be used
   commercially, and attribution to Eka Care must be retained. See
   docs/03-data-management.md.

2. NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE.

   This software is an academic research prototype providing clinical decision
   support. It is not a medical device, has undergone no clinical validation,
   and has received no regulatory approval. It must not be used for real
   patient care or for any diagnostic or treatment decision. See
   docs/04-safety-ethics.md.
